flowchart TB
  Browser[Next.js text / image / document / screen + voice UI]
  Frame[Explicit screen share + one-frame snapshot]
  Audio[Existing Phase 3 voice + Kokoro]
  Proxy[Next.js same-origin multimodal proxy]
  API[FastAPI multipart validations]
  PDF[PDF inline input_file]
  DOC[DOCX/TXT/CSV local text extraction]
  IMG[Image input_image base64]
  MUSE[Muse Spark Responses API]
  STATE[Prior response id / session continuity]
  Browser --> Proxy --> API
  Browser --> Frame --> Proxy
  Browser --> Audio
  API --> PDF --> MUSE
  API --> DOC --> MUSE
  API --> IMG --> MUSE
  MUSE <--> STATE
  MUSE -->|SSE answer| Browser
  Browser -->|Kokoro response| Audio
